1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:02,736
Heh. I'm just a little thirsty.

2
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,340
(Penny:)I got nothing.

3
00:00:10,286 --> 00:00:12,846
(Leonard:)Great. I'll go get my stuff.

4
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:21,120
(Penny:)Okay. All right, don't freak out.
You can make this work.

5
00:00:21,297 --> 00:00:26,137
(Leonard:)Oh. Could you clear off a shelf for me
in the bathroom? I take a lot of medicine.

6
00:00:27,503 --> 00:00:30,233
(Penny:)Oh, please, let some of it be Xanax.

7
00:00:34,444 --> 00:00:36,974
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Are you ready for dessert?

8
00:00:38,748 --> 00:00:40,118
(Raj:)No, thank you, Mrs. Wolowitz.

9
00:00:40,483 --> 00:00:43,183
As is, I'm going to have to carry
my stomach out of here...

10
00:00:43,386 --> 00:00:45,756
(Raj:)...like I'm a fireman rescuing an infant.

11
00:00:47,156 --> 00:00:51,186
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Oh, please, you're a tall glass
of brown water.

12
00:00:52,195 --> 00:00:55,135
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)- Have dessert.
- I really couldn't.

13
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:59,061
But I've had a lovely time eating your
brisket and hearing about the things...

